  "steps": [
    "Jam: heat the frozen raspberries with the sugar, cornstarch and lemon juice until thick. Cool.",
    "Cheesecake: mix the cream cheese, sugar, egg and vanilla.",
    "Crumble: mix the dry ingredients, pour in the melted butter and mix.",
